{"id":"wx2652707139","title":"振奋人心！2023，跑出华农“加速度”！","published_at":"2023-02-22T23:28:28+08:00","published_label":"2023-02-22","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEjdiao0KtTS6bNBJ64OCZHVhra1IGWueQd39lRrGa1iatjs1joPD2uckA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"新学期伊始 如何乘着中国式现代化新征程的东风 以“开局就冲刺、起步就争先”的精气神 奋力跑出高质量发展的华农“加速度”？ 2月22日 华南农业大学在丁颖礼堂召开 党委全委（扩大）会议暨人才工作会议 校党委副书记、校长刘雅红 主持大会并作工作…","tags":["科研","人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652707139&idx=1&sn=094849ec0eefec4e05de0edfdfefe204","paper_url":null,"word_count":3373,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T17:00:33+08:00","content_html":"<div><p><span>新学期伊始</span></p><p><span>如何乘着中国式现代化新征程的东风</span></p><p><span>以“开局就冲刺、起步就争先”的精气神</span></p><p><span>奋力跑出高质量发展的华农“加速度”？</span></p><p><strong><span>2月22日</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>华南农业大学在丁颖礼堂召开</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>党委全委（扩大）会议暨人才工作会议</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>校党委副书记、校长刘雅红</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>主持大会并作工作报告</span></strong></p><section><strong><span>对2023年重点工作进行部署</span></strong></section><p><strong><span>作为“新学期第一会”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>大会还聚焦学校人才队伍建设</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>提出将坚定不移实施人才强校战略</span></strong></p><p><span>加快出台“1+3”人才工作文件</span></p><p><span>推进实施人才队伍建设“六大工程”</span></p><p><span>为学校推进“双一流”建设</span></p><p><span>实现</span><span>高质量内涵式发展</span></p><section><span>提供坚强的人才支撑</span></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEVxRgZYOr13gwONjzISeZfWOCQx4z4AqsT3UKgWk8RoenNvyYicxUsWA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></section><section><span>会议现场</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEY6Gl7cBAMRmSxdtXGUibNSe5J5Zck7MtsRrVImZ3EBGUIxBFb2Asibjw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>校党委副书记、校长刘雅红主持大会并作工作报告</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>加快推进学校高质量内涵式发展</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>受校党委常委会委托</span></p><p><span>刘雅红作</span><span>《振奋精神 实干担当 乘势而上 </span></p><section><span>加快推进学校高质量发展》工作报告。</span><br/></section><section><span>2022年，学校进入国家“双一流”建设行列</span></section><section><span>统筹推进疫情防控和“争创一流”</span></section><section><span>在“大战大考”中勇毅前行、奋力争先</span></section><p><span><span><strong><span>各项工作取得显著成效</span></strong></span><span>：</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学习宣传贯彻党的二十大精神走深走实</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>党的全面领导和党的建设持续加强</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>经受住了疫情防控硬仗考验</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>“双一流”建设全面推进</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>一流人才培养体系建设加快推进</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>教师队伍素质能力不断提升</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>科研工作取得多方面突破</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>服务乡村振兴成效明显</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>开放合作办学不断拓展深化</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>内部治理和条件保障得到优化</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>民生实事项目扎实推进</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><span>“</span><strong><span>华农将把服务广东高质量发展</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span>尤其是乡村振兴摆在‘双一流’建设的突出位置</span></strong><span>，</span></span></section><section><strong><span>围绕深入实施‘百县千镇万村高质量发展工程’</span></strong></section><section><strong><span>和‘绿美广东生态建设’</span></strong><span>，</span></section><section><span>整合全校资源，创新体制机制，</span></section><section><span>在服务经济社会发展的生动实践中</span></section><section><span>培养造就人才、促进科技创新、</span></section><section><span>强化引领支撑作用，</span></section><p><span>为学校‘双一流’建设注入强大动力。”</span></p><p><span>刘雅红指出</span></p><p><strong><span>2023年，学校工作的总体思路是：</span></strong></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，以深入学习贯彻党的二十大精神为主线，突出高质量内涵式发展主题，认真贯彻落实中央农村工作会议、广东省高质量发展大会和全国、全省教育工作会议精神，齐心协力加油干，振奋精神创一流，以全面提高人才自主培养质量为重点，努力建设世界一流农业大学，在扎实推进广东高质量发展、实施“百县千镇万村高质量发展工程”和“绿美广东生态建设”中担当作为，为广东在全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程中走在全国前列、创造新的辉煌作出新贡献。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEqP48lnIAsmiaSryU8V7NW0zyAovzuXunLXICoDaYiardXicMrT2tbORQg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></p><p><span>会议现场</span></p><p><span>会议强调</span></p><p><span>做好今年工作，要重点把握好</span></p><p><strong><span>“一个</span></strong><strong><span>紧紧围绕</span></strong><strong><span>” “两个坚定不移”</span></strong></p><section><span>和</span><strong><span>“三个加快推进”</span></strong><span>：</span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>紧紧围绕</span></strong><span>“双一流”建设目标任务同向发力</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>坚定不移</span></strong><span>加强党的全面领导和党的建设，</span><strong>坚定不移</strong><span>走高质量内涵式发展道路</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>加快推进</span></strong><span>拔尖创新人才培养、学科交叉融合创新和干部教师队伍本领提升</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>今年，学校将重点推进</span></p><section><span><strong><span>十个方面的工作：</span></strong></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>深入学习宣传贯彻党的二十大精神，坚定自信自觉</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>●  </span>深入实施“1+6+N”宣讲行动，<span>加强理论研究阐释</span></span></section><p><span><span>●  坚持学用结合、知行合一</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>加强党的全面领导和党的建设，更好地凝聚人心和力量</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>●  </span></strong>坚持用总书记思想凝心铸魂</span></section><p><span><strong><span>●  </span></strong>建设与争创一流相适应的高素质干部队伍</span></p><p><span><strong><span>●  </span></strong>促进基层党建提质增效</span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>●  </span></span></strong><span>以严的主基调强化正风肃纪</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>●  </span></span></strong><span>加强统一战线和群团工作</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>不断完善人才培养体系，努力提高人才自主培养能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span><span>●  </span></span></strong><span>努力构建高质量思政工作体系</span></span></section><p><span><strong><span><span>●  </span></span></strong><span>努力构建一流本科人才培养体系</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>●  </span></span></strong><span>努力构建一流研究生人才培养体系</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>●  </span></span></strong>推进继续教育高质量发展</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>加强人才队伍建设，深化人事制度改革</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>●  </span>提高站位、凝聚共识、增强合力</span></span></section><section><span><span><span>●  </span>直面问题、咬定目标、破解难题</span></span></section><section><span><span><span>●  </span>加强统筹、突出重点、深化改革</span><strong></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>5</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>加强顶层设计和协调联动，推进学科建设上水平</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>●  </span>制定实施四大学科群建设方案</span></section><p><span><span><span><span>●  </span></span>创新学科管理体制机制</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>6</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>完善科技创新和服务体系，增强对经济社会发展的引领支撑能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span>●  加强科研攻关</span></section><p><span>●  加强科研平台建设</span></p><p><span>●  做好科技奖励的组织申报工作</span></p><p><span>●  在社会服务上展现新担当</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>7</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拓展深化对外交流合作，提高国际影响力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span>●  深化拓展全球高水平交流合作</span></section><p><span>●  着力提升国际化人才培养质量</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>8</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>优化内部治理体系，提高管理水平</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>●  </span>落实新修订的大学章程</span></section><p><span><span>●  </span>统筹推进校院两级管理体制改革</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>9</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>强化条件保障，提升服务水平</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>●  </span>多渠道筹措办学资源</span></section><p><span><span>●  </span>加强开源节流</span></p><p><span><span>●  </span>优化资源配置和综合利用</span></p><p><span><span>●  </span>着力推进校园基本建设</span></p><p><span><span>●  </span>提高物业精细化管理水平</span></p><p><span><span>●  </span>推进各领域智慧管理</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>10</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>办好民生实事，增进师生福祉</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>●  </span>努力解决<span>学</span><span>生宿舍修缮、<span>人才公寓建设、<span>新校医院建设、<span>食堂改造升级等</span></span></span></span></span><span>师生急难愁盼问题</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9iaVvctF0ksNOknG86XJBABP9IS1Gm4O8Wf39sUgnc5oF3GrDcx5aiaN3BXia83WsXAW98SgxuPX8Xg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/><br/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>坚定不移实施人才强校战略</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>“我们要深入贯彻国家和广东省有关人才工作的部署，加大力度建设一支师德高尚、业务精湛、结构合理的一流人才队伍。”就如何做好学校人才工作，</span><span>刘雅红强调，全校上下要凝聚共识、增强合力，直面问题、咬定目标，加强统筹、深化改革，形成人人立足岗位争做一流人才、共同推动落实人才强校战略的良好局面</span><span>。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEXVu3fWbcK4MJZcUJ4QtMadV3ATRFSgZicWht38ZTh9AXZQbcxcH763A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>副校长温小波作学校人才工作报告</span></p><p><span>副校长温小波以《坚定不移实施人才强校战略 奋力开创新时代学校人才工作高质量发展的新局面》为题，作学校人才工作报告，介绍了近年来学校人才队伍建设的做法与成效、面临的困难与挑战，以及一流人才队伍建设的思路与举措。材料与能源学院教授张超群、动物科学学院教授任文凯、生命科学学院教授王应祥作为高层次人才代表在会上交流发言。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbERTZJp1QmCHvKGPcQql9LDsuqjSOBQOoye7B15Jd1Q5yaPCSD40acZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span>材料与能源学院教授张超群</span><span>在会上交流发言</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbETRkuk3RMvDhR9ibv8njha9kvkU0p6q7Oe7QeLAo8eE29LcQDq2Q5DZg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span>动物科学学院教授任文凯在会上交流发言</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEiccuZ04NoTLIcQc2ftGYhs7KQkTjF5C5k9Vria82pDzeLC7O2DqRnF6A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>生命科学学院教授王应祥</span><span>在会上交流发言</span></p><p><span>2015年至今，学校新进海内外人才616人，新增2名院士，国家级人才增长2倍、省级人才翻倍……背后有何聚“才”密码？</span><span>据介绍，学校强化党管人才，深化人才体制机制改革，坚持引育并举，近年来，高层次人才在获得重大科技奖项、主持重大科研项目及发表高水平论文等方面成绩突出，为学校高质量发展作出了突出贡献。</span></p><p><strong><span>建设一流人才队伍，下一步怎么干？</span></strong><span>会议指出，学校将努力建设一支师德高尚、业务精湛、结构合理的一流人才队伍，着力打造一流人才队伍高地；大力推进团队化、青年化、国际化的人才队伍建设；实施高层次人才引领建设、创新团队建设、青年教师成长培养、深化人才发展体制机制改革、管理队伍能力提升、其他专业技术人员队伍建设六大工程。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbETk75pjSfqeqiagNaEZUFiaYAgN48115Vl5cTYFmttw7T5smL2Kp81yDQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><span>校党委副书记邓国安介绍</span></section><p><span>“1+3”人才工作文件草案的起草和修订情况</span></p><p><span>会上，校党委副书记邓国安介绍了学校《关于加强新时代人才工作的意见》《“丁颖学者”岗位计划实施办法》《“丁颖人才”培育计划实施办法》《人才引进和管理办法》等</span><strong><span>“1+3”人才工作文件</span></strong><span>草案的起草和修订情况。相关文件的出台，将进一步健全党管人才领导体制和工作格局，加强师德师风建设，完善人才发展体制机制，全方位培养、引进、用好人才，激发人才创新活力。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbERw9AUgfos9PdYS8qb3BuRB3gb80DkjWG6KtLCPU0fJKYLy6V7l7PUQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span>分组讨论</span></p><p><span>22日下午，会议围绕校党委常委会工作报告、工作要点、“1+3”文件等进行了分组讨论。校党委全委会议听取了分组讨论情况汇报，并审议通过了2023年工作要点及重点工作安排。</span></p><section><span>校党政领导，校党委委员、纪委委员，校工会委员会主席、常务副主席、副主席，学校教代会各代表团正、副团长，校学术委员会成员，各二级单位党政负责人及副处级以上干部，附小、幼儿园主要负责人，各民主党派组织、侨联会、党外知识分子联谊会主要负责人，离退休教职工协会主要负责人，校关心下一代工作委员会主任、副主任，各学院（教学部）正高职称教师、系（教研室）主任、教师代表、党政办主任、学工办主任、学科办或教学科研办主任、辅导员、教务员，校级以上研究中心（院、所）主任，各机关部处科长（主任）及不设科室单位的主任科员，各教辅单位内设机构主要负责人共900余人参加大会。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibHel8Up4NpWaHtRazGM9J9cicMiczFqUjBGM0w8fEoHHPe1XtAdibiaadHC9VcfBcuhCo1tEcibUNlYLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></p><section><span>2023年</span></section><section><span><span>是华农步入“双一流”建设的第二年</span></span></section><section><span>也是学校“十四五”规划承上启下的重要一年</span></section><section><span>站在开年之际</span></section><section><span>华农将加快推进学校高质量内涵式发展</span></section><section><span>坚定不移实施人才强校战略</span></section><section><span>以“开局就冲刺、起步就争先”的精气神</span></section><section><span><strong><span>奋力跑出高质量发展的</span></strong></span></section><section><span><strong><span>华农“加速度”</span></strong></span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/w4bIWyNFlc9PWVFvMxhxzwtYVAAQQTo2xrCAJlEYZGlyOOhIV6VSjP6OMKrVI2pvs3dRHm2kI0DMqrUc7UOkgA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652707083&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=698bcf07d3114e59ac7cb4c7600818ba&amp;chksm=bcd61a148ba1930263c5ad55dd842605dd06ab79e2596e7dde6773e0d151b799edfe17a4c055&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9wSm1wvObjCf4HFFy4ibNbEIZDBtP9DPTJicdVj5o5D877iatNb5rLRatuugknVeWoOJtHAoZlkib4tQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ 还在假期“狂飙”？醒醒，该一键切换开学模式了！（附校历）</p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652707072&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b7b8b15f7c13c9a3ea59821a3046a5ee&amp;chksm=bcd61a1f8ba193091bda29016db1c865b1eb16c9648e578349210b6218cfbda280021c634d36&amp;scene=21#wechat_redi